%% TECH-013 Security in the review and the pipeline
%% Where a change is checked for security, and what stops it.
flowchart TD
    A[Change on a branch] --> B{Touches sign-in, admin, API, actions, queries or personal data?}
    B -- yes --> C["/security-review (R2)"]
    B -- no --> D[Code review with its security points (R1)]
    C --> D
    D --> E[Pull request]
    E --> F[CI job security]
    F --> G["npm audit (R3)"]
    F --> H["Semgrep: community rules + sql-built-from-text (R4)"]
    F --> I["Gitleaks: the whole history (R5)"]
    G & H & I -- any fails --> X[Merge stopped]
    G & H & I -- all pass --> M[Merge]
    J["Dependabot (R6)"] -->|security update| E
